      "comment": "ROMAIKA (2) has shown good improvement at his last two starts, finishing in the money last time when 2nd at this track over 350m. Likely to feature again. SCOTCH BLASTER (3) was out of character last run when missing the frame, finishing fourth (24.07) in a Grade 5 at Casino. Normally fast to begin but shuffled back last time. Key runner on best form. ZIPPING BJORN (1) is rarely far away but tends to find one better, placing 19 from 30 starts. Has finished in the money at the last three runs. Has never been out of the money in six starts this course and distance. Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. Hard to beat again. CONFETTI DAN (6) can improve on an unplaced run here last time out.",
